     2981       sj-adv.qnty-2 (SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.grp-name)
     2982       sj-adv.qnty-3 (SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.grp-name)
     2983       sj-adv.brutto-sum (SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.grp-name)
