     4935                               DOWN STREAM PrnLibStream 1 with FRAME sj-base-t .
     4936     end.
     4937   end.
     4938                   if first-of( sj-goods.obj-attr ) AND ( ObjsQnty > 1 ) then  do:
     4939                           assign
     4940                           strbuf1 = substr( sj-goods.obj-attr, 1, 3 )
     4941                           intbuf1 = integer( substr( sj-goods.obj-attr, 4 ) ) .
     4942                           FIND FIRST cli-obj WHERE
